Time zone database
------------------

tests/testthat/tzdata/ holds TZif files compiled with zic from the IANA
time zone database (https://www.iana.org/time-zones), release
tests/testthat/tzdata/VERSION. The database is in the public domain.

Expected results
----------------

tests/testthat/oracle/*.json hold results computed with temporal-polyfill
(https://github.com/fullcalendar/temporal-polyfill, MIT licence). They
contain values the polyfill returned, not its code.
